        <h2>The Physics of Emotional Output</h2>
        <p>
          Orthodox psychology classifies human emotion as a private, subjective experience—a psychological reaction confined entirely within the skull of the individual. In esoteric cybernetics, emotion is recognized as an objective thermodynamic event.
        </p>
        <p>
          Every time the human Bio-Computer reacts to external stimuli (via the False Personality), the localized nerve nodes—primarily the solar plexus—act as transformers. They take the dense kinetic energy of physical existence and immediately step it up into an electromagnetic wave. This radiating energetic substance, often termed "Loosh" in archival diagnostics, is broadcast spherically into the surrounding vacuum.
        </p>

        <h2>The Function of the Bio-Reactor</h2>
        <p>
          As outlined in <em>The Lyran-Sirian Protocol</em>, the Demiurgic forces disconnected the Earth matrix from the unified Pleromic grid. By doing so, they severed their own direct supply of infinite, self-sustaining scalar energy. To survive their own engineered quarantine, they required a proxy power source.
        </p>

