        </blockquote>

        <h2>The Specificity of the Harvest</h2>
        <p>
          The matrix does not harvest uniformly. Pure Pleromic joy, absolute silence, and zero-point equilibrium vibrate at a scalar frequency far too rapid and subtle for the Archontic feeding tubes to grasp. The parasite requires density. It requires jagged, high-amplitude, low-frequency wavelengths.
        </p>
        <p>
